<title>FINLAND: ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TURKU, Finland 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ice hockey world</p>
<p>championship standings after Friday's games:</p>
<p>    Pool A		 P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> 1. Russia		 4   3   1   0  15   9   7</p>
<p> 2. Finland		4   3   0   1  18   5   6</p>
<p> 3. Czech Republic     4   3   0   1   9   6   6</p>
<p> 4. Slovakia	     4   1   1   2  10  13   3</p>
<p> 5. France		 4   1   0   3  10  17   2</p>
<p> 6. Germany		4   0   0   4   3  15   0</p>
<p>Last round: May 3 France v Czech Republic, Slovakia v</p>
<p>Germany, Russia v Finland.</p>
<p>    Pool B	   P  W  D  L  F  A Pts</p>
<p> 1. Sweden	   4  3  1  0 17  7   7</p>
<p> 2. U.S.	     4  3  0  1 13 12   6</p>
<p> 3. Canada	   4  2  1  1 17 11   5</p>
<p> 4. Italy	    4  1  1  2 12 15   3</p>
<p> 5. Latvia	   4  0  2  2 12 14   2</p>
<p> 6. Norway	   4  0  1  3  4 16   1</p>
<p>Top three teams qualify for medal round</p>
</text>
